From: Soren <3319253385@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 21:13:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?uart16550:=20=E5=8E=BB=E6=8E=89=20tfifo=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=87=8C=E7=9A=84=20$write=20=E6=98=BE=E7=A4=BA?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

$write 是 batch 模式的临时打印 hack；启用 nvboard 后 nvboard 会读
uart_tx 再打印一次，导致 TX 每个字符打双份。去掉 $write，统一走
nvboard 的 uart_tx。

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 perip/uart16550/rtl/uart_tfifo.v | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/perip/uart16550/rtl/uart_tfifo.v b/perip/uart16550/rtl/uart_tfifo.v
index 71329116..57adf1bf 100644
--- a/perip/uart16550/rtl/uart_tfifo.v
+++ b/perip/uart16550/rtl/uart_tfifo.v
@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@ begin
             begin
                 top   <= #1 top_plus_1;
                 count <= #1 count + 1'b1;
-                $write("%c", data_in);
+                // $write("%c", data_in);
             end
         2'b01 : if(count>0)
             begin
@@ -221,7 +221,7 @@ begin
         2'b11 : begin
                 bottom <= #1 bottom + 1'b1;
                 top    <= #1 top_plus_1;
-                $write("%c", data_in);
+                // $write("%c", data_in);
                 end
         default: ;
         endcase
-- 
2.43.0

